 "description": "Generate a complete short-form social video from a topic or supplied script, including narration, visual materials, subtitles and final video composition. When: Use when an agent needs a publish-ready TikTok, Reel, Short or generic social video from a topic or script. Selection: primary; prefer for Use when an agent needs a publish-ready TikTok, Reel, Short or generic social video from a topic or script.. Minimum required input: script, platform, style, materialSource, language, durationSeconds, aspectRatio, voice, subtitles, backgroundMusic. Price: $1.50 USD per call. A free preview is available through preview_capability before payment.",
